{"path":"keyword/requires","title":"C++ keyword: requires (since C++20)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">C++ keyword:</span><code>requires</code><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/keyword/requires","section":"keyword","kind":"index","summary":"","html":"<h3 id=\"Usage\">Usage</h3>\n<ul><li> specifies a constant expression on template parameters that <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/requires\">evaluate a requirement</a>\n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> within such a requirement, introduces a <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/requires#Nested_requirements\">nested requirement</a>\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<ul><li> in a template declaration, specifies an <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/constraints\"> associated constraint</a>\n</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/class\"><code>class</code></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/keywords/typename\"><code>typename</code></a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/template\"><code>template</code></a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/concept\"><code>concept</code></a>\n</li></ul>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Usage","id":"Usage"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"keyword","title":"C++ keywords"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"C++ keyword: requires (since C++20)","children":[{"label":"Usage"},{"label":"See also"}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":34,"codeBlockCount":0}
